## Secrets - never commit real configuration.
## appsettings.Development.json IS committed: it holds a local Windows-auth connection string and the
## documented demo passwords, and deliberately no signing key (the API generates an ephemeral one).
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
appsettings.local.json
*.pfx
*.p12
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

